portion 5.5 two anchors up to the top lane
portion 5.8 neon/white stones nWWW (3 wide, 3 apart) over current
portion 5.8 neon/white stones nWWn (3 wide, 3 apart) over current
portion 3.5 steps up 4 tall and back down (16 wide)
portion 4.7 hop 2 pull ports (high, ceiling), 7 apart, over current
portion 6.4 hop 5 floating blocks over current (heights 21213)
portion 4 a secret wall 10 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 4 a secret wall 12 wide with packets inside, or climb over it
portion 5 a low ceiling 10 long over a current notch
